        "problem": "Find ${lim}_{x\\to \\,\\pi }f(x).$ If the limit does not exist, write \"DNE\" (without the quotation marks).\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        ${lim}_{x\\to \\,\\pi }f(x)=$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}",
